1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,608
The battle starts.

2
00:00:01,658 --> 00:00:07,328
The Roman block charges into Hannibal's center, and at first, it's working.

3
00:00:07,378 --> 00:00:09,968
The Gauls and Spaniards are pushed back.

4
00:00:10,018 --> 00:00:11,688
Step by step.

5
00:00:11,738 --> 00:00:13,348
The crescent flattens.

6
00:00:13,398 --> 00:00:16,008
Then it caves inward.

7
00:00:16,058 --> 00:00:17,768
The Romans are winning.

8
00:00:17,818 --> 00:00:19,188
They can feel it.

9
00:00:19,238 --> 00:00:22,868
They push deeper and deeper into the gap.

10
00:00:22,918 --> 00:00:25,008
More men crowd in behind them.

11
00:00:25,058 --> 00:00:28,068
And then Hannibal says one word: 'Now.'

12
00:00:28,118 --> 00:00:34,708
On both sides, the African soldiers turn inward and slam into the Roman flanks with

13
00:00:34,758 --> 00:00:36,168
their spears.

14
00:00:36,218 --> 00:00:42,108
At the same time, Hannibal's heavy cavalry have already crushed the Roman horsemen

15
00:00:42,158 --> 00:00:43,548
by the river.

16
00:00:43,598 --> 00:00:45,808
But they don't stop to celebrate.

17
00:00:45,858 --> 00:00:47,788
They don't chase the runners.

18
00:00:47,838 --> 00:00:52,088
They ride all the way around, behind the Roman army.

19
00:00:52,138 --> 00:00:56,428
They help the Numidians drive off the last Roman cavalry units.

20
00:00:56,478 --> 00:00:59,488
Then they charge straight into the Roman rear.

21
00:00:59,538 --> 00:01:02,340
The Roman army is completely surrounded.

